{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0129xfW6NtLf8qhwsPVwLRsS","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"latest React version release react.dev blog\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"React のバージョン\",\"url\":\"https://ja.react.dev/versions\"},{\"title\":\"React Versions\",\"url\":\"https://zh-hant.react.dev/versions\"},{\"title\":\"React Blog\",\"url\":\"https://az.react.dev/blog\"},{\"title\":\"React Blog\",\"url\":\"https://react.dev/blog\"},{\"title\":\"React Blog\",\"url\":\"https://mn.react.dev/blog\"},{\"title\":\"React Blog\",\"url\":\"https://zh-hant.react.dev/blog\"},{\"title\":\"What is the latest version of React, and what new features does it include?\",\"url\":\"https://www.c-sharpcorner.com/forums/what-is-the-latest-version-of-react\"},{\"title\":\"DEV Community\",\"url\":\"https://dev.to/brilworks/react-latest-version-exploring-new-features-updates-23m1\"},{\"title\":\"uk.legacy.reactjs.org\",\"url\":\"https://uk.legacy.reactjs.org/versions\"}]\n\nThe latest React version on react.dev appears to be **19.2**, though the search results are cached snapshots, so check the live site to confirm.\n\n- **Versions page:** The react.dev versions page lists Latest version: 19.2.\n- **Release post:** The blog's 19.2 announcement is dated October 1, 2025, and describes new features including Activity, React Performance Tracks, and useEffectEvent (React 19.2 adds new features like Activity, React Performance Tracks, useEffectEvent, and more.).\n- **Related releases:** React Compiler reached its first stable release, v1.0, on October 7, 2025.\n- **Security patch:** A critical vulnerability in React Server Components was fixed in 19.0.1, 19.1.2, and 19.2.1, and the blog recommends upgrading immediately.\n- **Newest blog post in the results:** The React Foundation launch, dated February 24, 2026, under the Linux Foundation.\n\nSome third-party articles still name 19.1.0 as the latest, so they are out of date.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8afadffb-e27a-49e4-88ac-027a0ee49e8d","uuid":"6bed5cbb-1cfc-4cdd-a902-26065cb1fba4","timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:46:25.545Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"latest React version release react.dev blog","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Lj5pgpUz1mkF1kYM82Ymia","content":[{"title":"React のバージョン","url":"https://ja.react.dev/versions"},{"title":"React Versions","url":"https://zh-hant.react.dev/versions"},{"title":"React Blog","url":"https://az.react.dev/blog"},{"title":"React Blog","url":"https://react.dev/blog"},{"title":"React Blog","url":"https://mn.react.dev/blog"},{"title":"React Blog","url":"https://zh-hant.react.dev/blog"},{"title":"What is the latest version of React, and what new features does it include?","url":"https://www.c-sharpcorner.com/forums/what-is-the-latest-version-of-react"},{"title":"DEV Community","url":"https://dev.to/brilworks/react-latest-version-exploring-new-features-updates-23m1"},{"title":"uk.legacy.reactjs.org","url":"https://uk.legacy.reactjs.org/versions"}]},"The latest React version on react.dev appears to be **19.2**, though the search results are cached snapshots, so check the live site to confirm.\n\n- **Versions page:** The react.dev versions page lists Latest version: 19.2.\n- **Release post:** The blog's 19.2 announcement is dated October 1, 2025, and describes new features including Activity, React Performance Tracks, and useEffectEvent (React 19.2 adds new features like Activity, React Performance Tracks, useEffectEvent, and more.).\n- **Related releases:** React Compiler reached its first stable release, v1.0, on October 7, 2025.\n- **Security patch:** A critical vulnerability in React Server Components was fixed in 19.0.1, 19.1.2, and 19.2.1, and the blog recommends upgrading immediately.\n- **Newest blog post in the results:** The React Foundation launch, dated February 24, 2026, under the L